Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:39.98,EpTitle,,0,0,0,,我绝对会用我这双手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:04.57,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,所以要制作选美比赛的服装吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:06.05,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,这次是西装啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:09.43,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我也会尽我所能帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:12.28,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,分工合作进行制作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:14.19,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,就和制作女儿节娃娃一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:15.85,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:18.86,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,女儿节娃娃也是采分工制作的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:24.36,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,脸 服装 手 配件 头发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:25.80,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,和最后的收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.66,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,都是分别由不同人负责的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:30.64,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,以我们的店里来说 制作一个人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:32.35,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,就需要10个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:34.21,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,这 这么多吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:38.23,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,面相也不是全都由一个人绘制
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:40.25,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,而是依据脸的部位区分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:43.42,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我完全不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:44.19,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,话说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:47.39,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,每天大概可以帮几个女儿节娃娃化妆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:49.80,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,大约两百到三百个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:53.66,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.73,0:00:56.19,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,差不多就那么多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.69,0:01:00.00,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,因为帮女儿节娃娃化妆看起来很难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.82,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我还以为只有大约10个左右
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:04.11,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,10个？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:09.26,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,这样会赶不上出货的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:12.01,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我又不是故意搞笑才这样说的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:16.16,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我们也是受了许多人的帮助才能走到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.37,0:01:20.13,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,全部都想靠自己来做 不但负荷不来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:21.88,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,还会让自己喘不过气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.30,0:01:24.40,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,要帮助人是很简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.46,0:01:28.43,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,但要请别人帮忙 却是相当困难的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:34.06,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,也得依靠他人才行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.73,0:01:39.31,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我要再盛一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:43.78,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在文化祭之前都会比较晚回来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.03,0:01:45.25,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,要不要我先做些家事？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:46.34,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,洗衣服也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:47.11,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:48.95,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你的腰又痛起来的话就不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.11,0:01:50.26,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我说你啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:52.47,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,我已经说我没事了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.53,0:01:53.83,Dial-CN,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:09.20,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}アオイハル 続いてく未来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.20,0:02:10.66,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}なんでもない なんでもない 今日も
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:12.14,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}キミとなら Make it fun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:29.51,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}踊る風にさそわれた 坂道の向こうがわに
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:35.25,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}こまでも広がる青瞳を奪われて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:39.90,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}音立てる ときめきの予感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:45.80,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}真っ白な秘めた気持ちが 色づいてゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:48.28,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}さぁ 行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:53.70,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}キミと 紬いでく未来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:59.29,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}今はまだ手探りで迷っても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:04.59,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}放物線描き出す光
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:10.68,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}七色の明日が呼んでる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:13.47,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}道しるべ なくたって
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:16.22,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}不安なら わけあって
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:18.98,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}キミがいる いつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:21.80,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}ほら笑って Hi-Five
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:09.20,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}稚嫩的青春 延续向未来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.20,0:02:10.66,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}平凡无奇 平凡无奇 今天也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:12.14,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}和你在一起 Make it fun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:29.51,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}受到起舞的风邀请 去到坡道另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:35.25,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}无边无际的蓝 吸引了我的双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:39.90,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}发出声响的 悸动预感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:45.80,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}隐藏的纯白心情 逐渐染上色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:48.28,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}来吧 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:53.70,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}与你 一起编织 未来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:59.29,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}就算现在还在摸索 还在迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:04.59,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}描绘出 抛物线的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:10.68,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}七彩的明天 正在呼唤我们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:13.47,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}即使没有 路标
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:16.22,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}有不安 就一起分担
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:18.98,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}有你在 永远
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:21.80,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}来 笑一个吧 Hi-Five
